<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas signs pact with Hungary.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas signs pact with Hungary.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonnell Douglas Corp said it and representatives of the government of Hungary signed an industrial cooperation agreement in Budapest.</p>
<p>It said the &quot;protocol&quot; agreement lays a foundation for partnerships between McDonnell Douglas and Hungarian industry ahead of any aerospace sale to the government.</p>
<p>Hungary is considering the aerospace company's F/A-18 Hornet as a way to modernize its air force, the company noted.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
